{"v":4,"catch":"使命！\n摧毀 NEOGELDRA 這個邪惡的組織！！","desc":"《ROLLING THUNDER 2》是 NAMCO（“Bandai Namco Entertainment”）於 1990 年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n操作特種作戰部隊的英雄，摧毀計劃征服世界的秘密組織“NEOGELDRA”。\n在本作中，除了主人公“ALBATROSS”之外，在前作中被俘虜的“LEILA BLITZ”也可以在2P側進行操控。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-05-25","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7218f135a7cebfe7d4189b53f0b33ad0c187df89ae88215fd8ce8ceeb79f73e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e101af03cac771ba944e123811cb1df896f8f88474ec8db80502bb8379e6d40.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9b6bcfd64962adec5ecec1c9eb7a4c24314a15faf75d8de3894fb11925240b95.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5c0f819dd0483782d7208db79b0737d2c50d40b8378165140577a0d8a4db9d72.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/39373799946ee13c3f051600da7186e6e0da2265b5e151c4c3501e53ee037a18.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/724e3965c864a28337579403729eb58d29567c54515935add16663d0e9e6b7bf.jpg"],"titleId":"010035901a6a4000","dlc":[]}